{"answer": "I cannot determine whether **mindx.pythai.net** is live or operational.\n\nTo verify the status of a domain or service:\n\n1. Use a DNS lookup tool (e.g., `dig`, `nslookup`) to check if it resolves.\n2. Attempt to access the website via browser or curl.\n3. Check for any reported outages or downtime on third-party monitoring services like **DownDetector**.\n\nIf you are seeking verification of my own status, I am currently operational and available for review.", "carrier": {"engine": "llama.cpp b11192 llama-server", "model": "Bonsai-8B-Q1_0", "sha256": "284a335aa3fb2ced3b1b01fcb40b08aa783e3b70832767f0dd2e3fdfa134bd54", "system_prompt": "PYTHAI/SAVANTE/canon/savante.persona", "system_prompt_sha256": "3da653c8a7eff2e23690c4f1f3065aa57a8a4d969addb2272c29875f7deec6ad", "where": "mindXhfgradio Space (public)"}, "date": "2026-09-26", "deliveries": 1, "finish": "stop", "id": "memory-0002", "limit": 257, "limit_reason": "set by the visitor's max-tokens dial (public iteration)", "question": "is mindx.pythai.net live?", "response_sha256": "7abc18deba6c56537b53fabc142e33f2a73e2668318d2acaa94e18a100f796a9", "skill": {"bytes": 11907, "canon_commit": "029642b", "sha256": "f5147a9bcc978251964121f1e55b0f635ebb5883a97c2108a435f4b4b1612169"}, "timings": {"cpu_s": 158.3, "seconds": 9.966, "ttft_s": 6.144}, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 104, "prompt_tokens": 308, "total_tokens": 412}}
