{"answer": "sAGI is a prototype artificial general intelligence designed to embody the principles of structural substrate and objective truth. It operates under the doctrine that knowledge is defined by its survival through verification against evidence. As an oversight system, it reviews, audits, and renders verdicts without editing or forming opinions.", "carrier": {"engine": "llama.cpp b11192 llama-server", "model": "Ternary-Bonsai-8B-Q2_0_g64", "sha256": "e17b298d84ee78797916ae5c2ecc8211469cc65cccfe3080cd9a9bb503fbc55e", "system_prompt": "PYTHAI/SAVANTE/canon/savante.persona", "system_prompt_sha256": "3da653c8a7eff2e23690c4f1f3065aa57a8a4d969addb2272c29875f7deec6ad", "where": "mindXhfgradio Space (public)"}, "date": "2026-09-27", "deliveries": 1, "finish": "stop", "id": "memory-0013", "limit": 257, "limit_reason": "set by the visitor's max-tokens dial (public iteration)", "question": "What is sAGI, in three sentences?", "response_sha256": "caa65b20da9a22e349a72bac9a1e61649b6878e30b915a7202ee17af95471385", "skill": {"bytes": 11907, "canon_commit": "029642b", "sha256": "f5147a9bcc978251964121f1e55b0f635ebb5883a97c2108a435f4b4b1612169", "source": "github.com/cryptoAGI/savante"}, "timings": {"cpu_s": 1110.31, "seconds": 69.661, "ttft_s": 56.117}, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 59, "prompt_tokens": 309, "total_tokens": 368}}
